<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋疾自投醫院</title><title type="alternate">Feng ji zi tou yi yuan [A Man Admits Himself to Hospital]</title><author>無署名（《東華報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.1.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.1.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華報</title><date when="1925-11-28">1925-11-28</date><idno>Tung Wah Times, 1925-11-28, p. 7, NLA news-page24101368</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24101368">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="7" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24101368/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="7" facs="#original-page" /><head>瘋疾自投醫院</head><p><lb n="single-1" />本埠警察。。聞有瘋疾嫌疑之華人某<lb n="single-2" />甲。。由加立頓埠來抵雪梨。。經即四<lb n="single-3" />出偵探其人蹤跡。。本月廿二號早。。<lb n="single-4" />探悉某甲寓於羅士啤菜園內。。前往<lb n="single-5" />搜查。。他適出外。。至四點鐘。。警察<lb n="single-6" />又至該園。。而某甲已先行投入列度<lb n="single-7" />啤防疫醫院云。。</p></div></body></text></TEI>